From 84920d94ee8a3d9c3451241fd0f13041984ca63e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lei Zhang <antiagainst@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 19:15:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Bump LLVM to 850a2b1b975c

Advance the consumed LLVM revision to 850a2b1b975c061ae0fc982ba68064d305485cb2, the local branch tip that reverts d226dcc019d6 ("[NVPTX] Fix illegal combineInsertEltToShuffle pattern (#198259)"). That branch also carries fced504af64e, which reverts c3fc506e29ba ("[AMDGPU] Remove explicit PartialThreshold setting in loop unrolling (#198901)").

The Triton source updates are required by upstream LLVM commit 6e6c296f20149b0a9e793c2d526566bddb162939 ("[mlir] Use explicit op targets for region successors (#203552)"). That MLIR change replaces the RegionSuccessor parent sentinel with explicit Operation * successors, so downstream uses of RegionSuccessor::parent() become RegionSuccessor(op), and successor.isParent() checks become successor.isOperation().

Validated against the local LLVM build at /home/lzhang20/build/mlir-release.

Tested: make; make test-cpp; make test-lit; pytest -s --tb=short python/test/gluon/test_frontend.py; pytest -s --tb=short python/test/unit/language/test_frontend.py.
